IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cca-patron`

-- Casino Control Act 1984 (WA), ss 22, 23, 26, 26A, 27, 27A, and Casino Control Regulations 1999 r 4 and Schedule 1 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_casino-control-act-1984_baseline.py).
-- Expected results were written by hand from the text.
--
-- Facts from the WA lives (workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-jake): Jake, 39, goes to the casino on paydays (k080);
-- in 2046 his sister Chloe looks for a family exclusion order and he self-excludes (k081). A self-exclusion is taken to be a
-- casino direction under s 26(2) given at his request: the encoder's assumption, since the Act does not mention one. His
-- daughter Ruby (13 in 2046) at the casino is the encoder's illustration of s 27.

§ `fixtures`

`no ban` MEANS `My ban` WITH
    `who banned me` IS `nobody`
    `hours since the ban was made` IS 0
    `the person who made it has revoked it` IS FALSE
    `the Commission has revoked it on review and given notice` IS FALSE
    `the casino has been given written notice of the ban` IS FALSE
    `the casino has been given written notice of the revocation` IS FALSE

