    `hours since the ban was made` IS 2000
    `the person who made it has revoked it` IS FALSE
    `the Commission has revoked it on review and given notice` IS FALSE
    `the casino has been given written notice of the ban` IS FALSE
    `the casino has been given written notice of the revocation` IS FALSE

