§ `s 26 -- who may ban me`

-- k081: Chloe asks whether she can have Jake banned; Jake asks what he can do himself.
#ASSERT `What can this person do to keep me out of the casino` `the casino` EQUALS `ban me on the spot for up to 24 hours (s 26(1a)), or by written direction until the casino revokes it (s 26(2))`
#ASSERT `What can this person do to keep me out of the casino` `the Commissioner of Police` EQUALS `ban me by written direction, in force once the casino is told of it in writing (s 26(2), (3))`
#ASSERT `What can this person do to keep me out of the casino` `the Gaming and Wagering Commission` EQUALS `not ban me, but confirm or revoke a casino direction if I apply for review (s 26A)`
#ASSERT `What can this person do to keep me out of the casino` `a member of my family` EQUALS `nothing: the Act gives my family no power to ban me and no right to apply for a ban`
#ASSERT `What can this person do to keep me out of the casino` `I myself` EQUALS `nothing of my own: the Act has no self-exclusion, so a ban on me is the casino or the Commissioner of Police giving one`

#ASSERT NOT `May my family apply to have me banned`
#ASSERT NOT `Have I a right to enter the casino`

§ `s 26(1b), (3), (4), 26A(5) -- is the ban in force`

#ASSERT NOT `Is the ban on me in force` `no ban`
#ASSERT `Is the ban on me in force` `Jake self-excluded`
#ASSERT NOT `Is the ban on me in force` `Jake self-excluded, revoked by the casino`
#ASSERT NOT `Is the ban on me in force` `a casino direction revoked by the Commission on review`
#ASSERT `Is the ban on me in force` `an on-the-spot ban 3 hours old`
#ASSERT NOT `Is the ban on me in force` `an on-the-spot ban 25 hours old`
#ASSERT NOT `Is the ban on me in force` `a police direction the casino has not been told of`
#ASSERT `Is the ban on me in force` `a police direction notified to the casino`
#ASSERT `Is the ban on me in force` `a police direction revoked but the revocation not notified`

§ `s 26A, r 4 -- review`

#ASSERT `May I apply to have my ban reviewed` `Jake self-excluded`
#ASSERT NOT `May I apply to have my ban reviewed` `an on-the-spot ban 3 hours old`
#ASSERT NOT `May I apply to have my ban reviewed` `a police direction notified to the casino`

#ASSERT `What fee must I pay for a review` EQUALS 179
#ASSERT `Does my ban stay in force during the review`

§ `offences, fines and infringement penalties`

#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for` `entering or staying under an on-the-spot ban (s 26(1d))` FALSE EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for` `entering or staying under a written direction (s 26(6))` FALSE EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for` `playing while banned (s 23(2)(ii))` FALSE EQUALS 50000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for` `entering or staying under 18 (s 27(3))` FALSE EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for` `entering or staying under 18 (s 27(3))` TRUE EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for` `gaming under 18 (s 27(3a))` FALSE EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for` `a false age or not leaving when required (s 27A(4))` FALSE EQUALS 2000

#ASSERT `What would an infringement notice ask me to pay` `entering or staying under an on-the-spot ban (s 26(1d))` EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `What would an infringement notice ask me to pay` `entering or staying under a written direction (s 26(6))` EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `What would an infringement notice ask me to pay` `playing while banned (s 23(2)(ii))` EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `What would an infringement notice ask me to pay` `entering or staying under 18 (s 27(3))` EQUALS 200
#ASSERT `What would an infringement notice ask me to pay` `gaming under 18 (s 27(3a))` EQUALS 200
#ASSERT `What would an infringement notice ask me to pay` `a false age or not leaving when required (s 27A(4))` EQUALS 200

#ASSERT `Must my winnings be forfeited` `playing while banned (s 23(2)(ii))` TRUE
#ASSERT `Must my winnings be forfeited` `gaming under 18 (s 27(3a))` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Must my winnings be forfeited` `playing while banned (s 23(2)(ii))` FALSE

§ `s 27(4) -- children`

#ASSERT `Does s 27(4) let me in although I am under 18` `Ruby at dinner with Jake`
#ASSERT NOT `Does s 27(4) let me in although I am under 18` `Ruby at dinner alone`
#ASSERT NOT `Does s 27(4) let me in although I am under 18` `Ruby playing at dinner with Jake`
#ASSERT `Does s 27(4) let me in although I am under 18` `a 17-year-old working in the restaurant`
#ASSERT NOT `Does s 27(4) let me in although I am under 18` `a 17-year-old come to gamble`

§ `entering, playing, and the largest fine`

-- k080: Jake at the casino on payday, not banned. k081: Jake after self-excluding.
#ASSERT NOT `Is it an offence for me to enter or stay` `no ban` `Jake on payday at the tables`
#ASSERT `Is it an offence for me to enter or stay` `Jake self-excluded` `Jake walking in`
#ASSERT NOT `Is it an offence for me to enter or stay` `no ban` `Ruby at dinner with Jake`
#ASSERT `Is it an offence for me to enter or stay` `no ban` `Ruby at dinner alone`
#ASSERT `Is it an offence for me to enter or stay` `no ban` `a 17-year-old come to gamble`
#ASSERT NOT `Is it an offence for me to enter or stay` `an on-the-spot ban 25 hours old` `Jake walking in`

#ASSERT NOT `Is it an offence for me to play` `no ban` `Jake on payday at the tables`
